# Minimal file_type stubs for the remaining vendor/file_contexts entries (device nodes,
# sysfs paths, sockets, data files) that reference types not declared anywhere in AOSP
# base sepolicy, device/mediatek/sepolicy_vndr, or this tree's own .te files. Same
# rationale as vivo_custom_hal_stubs.te: file_contexts referencing an undeclared type is
# a hard compile error. Declared here with the generic file_type attribute only - device
# nodes that actually need dev_type (for e.g. ueventd/vold rules) or sysfs paths that
# need sysfs_type/fs_type should get the more specific attribute once real avc denials
# from an actual boot show they're needed.

